# Wifecraft's demo: "A Day in Dalaran". Its own story, not the game's.
# People: alleria, nyrelle (and her nightsaber, saber), you (the player), narrator.
# Places and their marks: assets/places.json. Emotes: talk, exclaim, question, bow, wave, cheer,
# laugh, rude, kiss, cry, shy, point, salute, yes, no, applaud, flex, roar.

alleria +10
nyrelle +10

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Prologue
fadeout 0
scene overlook day
letterbox on
shot view sweep_a
fadein 1500
shot view sweep_b 9000
wait 2600
title Wifecraft | A Day in Dalaran
wait 2400
narrator: Dalaran hangs above the Broken Isles. The Legion's fires have finally gone cold.
narrator: You came for a week of quiet, {name}. The city has other plans.
fadeout 900

scene krasus day
cast alleria rail face out
cast you arrive face rail
shot view landing
fadein 900
walk you near 3200
shot view behind 3200
wait 3300
face alleria you
shot bust alleria 900
letterbox off
wait 500

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Chapter I
title Chapter I | Morning
alleria [talk]: You walk like someone who has never seen the Isles from up here.
choice What do you say?
  > Is it that obvious? | alleria +5 | goto a_obvious
  > I was looking at you, not the Isles. | alleria +10 | goto a_bold
  > Who's asking? | goto a_wary
end

:a_obvious
alleria [laugh]: Only to someone who has stood here a thousand times.
goto a_name
:a_bold
alleria [laugh]: Bold. Dalaran's mages would call that reckless.
alleria [talk]: I find I don't mind it.
goto a_name
:a_wary
alleria [question]: Careful. In this city, everyone is asking something.
goto a_name

:a_name
alleria [bow]: Alleria Windrunner. Ranger of Quel'Thalas.
alleria [talk]: Lately, a stranger in my own skin. The Void leaves fingerprints.
you: {name}. Just arrived.
alleria [point]: Then a warning, {name}. Mind the streets. Some visitors don't watch where they run.
choice How do you leave it?
  > I'll be careful. Will I see you again? | alleria +10
  > I can look after myself. | alleria +5
end
alleria [talk]: Krasus' Landing, most days. When the city is too loud.
fadeout 700

scene street day
cast you mid face north
cast saber start face you
shot view street
fadein 600
letterbox on
wait 400
run saber past 900
shot view street_low 500
wait 650
shake 500
emote you no
wait 500
cast nyrelle behind face you
run nyrelle close 1400
shot two nyrelle you 1200
wait 1500
face nyrelle you
letterbox off
shot bust nyrelle 700
nyrelle [exclaim]: Elune's light! Are you hurt?
nyrelle [talk]: I'm glad you're okay. You hit your head pretty badly!
choice What do you say?
  > I've had worse from a sword. | nyrelle +5 | goto n_sword
  > Your cat owes me an apology. | nyrelle +10 | goto n_cat
  > Keep that thing on a leash. | nyrelle -5 | goto n_leash
end

:n_sword
nyrelle [laugh]: A fighter, then. Good. Dalaran is full of people who'd have fainted.
goto n_name
:n_cat
nyrelle [laugh]: She is not a cat. Don't tell her you said that.
nyrelle [shy]: ...But yes. She owes you one.
goto n_name
:n_leash
nyrelle [no]: A Sentinel's saber is no one's pet. She chose to follow me.
nyrelle [talk]: Still. I'm sorry.
goto n_name

:n_name
nyrelle [bow]: Nyrelle Moonquill. Sentinel, far from Darnassus, and lost among mages.
nyrelle [talk]: This city hums. Every stone is full of magic. My people learned to fear that.
nyrelle [question]: You don't seem to mind it. Will you show me it isn't all dangerous?
choice What do you say?
  > Of course. We'll start with the bakery. | nyrelle +10
  > It's mostly dangerous. That's the fun. | nyrelle +5
  > Find a mage to ask. | nyrelle -5
end
nyrelle [laugh]: Then I'll find you again, {name}. Or she will.
fadeout 800

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Chapter II
scene plaza day
cast you centre face steps
shot view plaza
fadein 800
title Chapter II | Afternoon
choice Where do you spend the afternoon?
  > Walk Krasus' Landing with Alleria. | goto alleria_day
  > Help Nyrelle find her runaway saber. | goto nyrelle_day
  > Wander the city on your own. | goto alone_day
end

# ---- Alleria's afternoon
:alleria_day
set route_alleria
fadeout 700
scene krasus dusk
cast alleria rail face out
cast you near face rail
shot view behind
fadein 900
wait 600
face alleria you
shot bust alleria 900
alleria [talk]: You came. Most people find the Landing too quiet.
alleria [question]: Do you know what I see when I look at the Isles?
choice What do you think she sees?
  > Everything you fought to save. | alleria +10
  > Everything you lost. | alleria +5
  > The way home. | alleria +20
end
alleria [talk]: All of it, I think. And the shadow in me that wants none of it.
alleria [talk]: Some days the Void whispers that I'm alone. It lies. It's usually lying.
choice What do you say?
  > You're not alone. Not today. | alleria +20
  > Then I'll keep you company until it stops. | alleria +10
  > Maybe you should rest. | alleria +0
end
alleria [laugh]: Kind words. I'm not used to them from strangers.
alleria [talk]: Meet me on the Citadel's terrace tonight. The city is different after dark.
fadeout 900
goto night

# ---- Nyrelle's afternoon
:nyrelle_day
set route_nyrelle
fadeout 700
scene plaza day
cast nyrelle steps face you
cast you centre face steps
cast saber hide face you
shot bust nyrelle
fadein 800
nyrelle [exclaim]: There you are! She's gone again. She hates portals, and the whole city is portals.
nyrelle [question]: Where would you hide, if you were a nightsaber?
choice Where do you look?
  > Somewhere high, where she can watch everything. | nyrelle +10 | goto n_high
  > Somewhere warm, near the bakery. | nyrelle +20 | goto n_warm
  > Just call her name. | nyrelle +5 | goto n_call
end
:n_high
nyrelle [yes]: She does love a rooftop.
goto n_found
:n_warm
nyrelle [laugh]: You've met her, haven't you?
goto n_found
:n_call
nyrelle [talk]: She only answers when she wants to. Like all cats. Don't tell her I said that.
goto n_found
:n_found
letterbox on
shot view plaza_wide 1200
walk saber found 2200
wait 2300
face nyrelle saber
emote nyrelle cheer
wait 1500
face nyrelle you
letterbox off
shot two nyrelle you 900
nyrelle [laugh]: Found her! Or she found us.
nyrelle [shy]: Thank you, {name}. I thought this city would be cold. It isn't, with you in it.
choice What do you say?
  > I'm glad I got knocked over. | nyrelle +20
  > Anytime. She can find me anywhere. | nyrelle +10
  > Try to keep her close next time. | nyrelle +0
end
nyrelle [talk]: Come to the Citadel's terrace tonight. The moon shows from there. Elune's light.
fadeout 900
goto night

# ---- Wandering alone
:alone_day
fadeout 700
scene street day
cast you mid face north
shot view street
fadein 800
narrator: You wander. Dalaran's streets curl around you, full of mages, merchants and the smell of bread.
narrator: Twice you think you see a ranger's green cloak. Once, a flash of a nightsaber's tail.
choice Do you follow either?
  > Follow the green cloak. | alleria +5
  > Follow the nightsaber. | nyrelle +5
  > Keep wandering. | set wanderer
end
narrator: The afternoon slips away before you notice.
fadeout 900
goto night

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Chapter III
:night
title Chapter III | Night
if flag route_alleria goto night_alleria
if flag route_nyrelle goto night_nyrelle
goto night_alone

:night_alleria
scene terrace night
cast alleria partner face view
cast you arrive face partner
shot view terrace_wide
fadein 1000
walk you beside 2500
shot two alleria you 2500
wait 2600
face alleria you
face you alleria
shot bust alleria 900
alleria [talk]: You came.
alleria [talk]: From up here the city looks like it's made of starlight. Easy to forget it's made of people.
if alleria >= 60 goto alleria_romance
if alleria >= 20 goto alleria_friend
goto alone_end

:alleria_romance
alleria [talk]: I've spent a long time listening to things that lie to me.
alleria [talk]: You haven't, once. That's rare enough that I mean to keep it.
choice What do you do?
  > Take her hand.
  > Stand closer, and say nothing.
end
letterbox on
shot two alleria you 1600
emote alleria bow
wait 1800
emote you kiss
wait 1600
fadeout 1600
ending windrunner

:alleria_friend
alleria [talk]: Thank you for today, {name}. You'd make a good ranger. You notice things.
alleria [salute]: If the Void gets loud again, I know where to find a friend.
letterbox on
shot view terrace_wide 2000
wait 2000
fadeout 1400
ending arrows

:night_nyrelle
scene terrace night
cast nyrelle partner face view
cast saber lie face view
cast you arrive face partner
shot view terrace_wide
fadein 1000
walk you beside 2500
shot two nyrelle you 2500
wait 2600
face nyrelle you
face you nyrelle
shot bust nyrelle 900
nyrelle [talk]: There. Do you see her? Elune's light, even above a city of mages.
if nyrelle >= 60 goto nyrelle_romance
if nyrelle >= 20 goto nyrelle_friend
goto alone_end

:nyrelle_romance
nyrelle [shy]: My people say the moon watches over the ones we choose.
nyrelle [talk]: I think... I'd like her to watch over you, too. With me.
choice What do you do?
  > Kiss her.
  > Tell her you choose her too.
end
letterbox on
shot two nyrelle you 1600
emote nyrelle kiss
wait 1800
emote saber roar
wait 1400
fadeout 1600
ending moonlight

:nyrelle_friend
nyrelle [laugh]: You and Shadowpaw are friends now. That means you're stuck with both of us.
nyrelle [wave]: Goodnight, {name}. Thank you for showing me the city isn't all dangerous.
letterbox on
shot view terrace_wide 2000
wait 2000
fadeout 1400
ending saber

:night_alone
scene terrace night
cast you beside face view
shot view terrace_wide
fadein 1000
goto alone_end

:alone_end
narrator: The city glows beneath you. Somewhere below, someone laughs; somewhere, a portal hums.
narrator: Tomorrow, perhaps. Dalaran will still be here.
letterbox on
shot view terrace_wide 2500
wait 2500
fadeout 1400
ending strangers
